{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p022a","title":"《魏书》载刘表托荆州于刘备","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p022a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》称刘表病笃托荆州于刘备，刘备以不忍薄待刘表而拒绝；此说另受裴松之反驳。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p022a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p023-judgment","label":"裴松之按语","text":"裴松之认为刘表夫妇久定立刘琮之计，无缘临终以荆州授刘备，否定前引《魏书》之说。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p023-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-biao","role":"托付","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p022a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"辞让","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p022a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"荆州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p022a-q"]},"time":{"year":208,"label":"刘表病笃时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o024","basis":"刘表病笃时"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-p022a-q","xianzhu-q-o024","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"]},"source_order":[32,129,"P022a"],"order":6537}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-biao","name":"刘表","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p022a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-285d8a94c9be71405f2c","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“表病笃，托国于备，顾谓曰：‘我儿不才，而诸将并零落；我死之后，卿便摄荆州。’备曰：‘诸子自贤，君其忧病！’或劝备宜从表言，备曰：‘此人待我厚；今从其言，人必以我为薄：所不忍也。’”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-46ef7bedb5c1d15794d0","start":0,"end":97},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p023-judgment","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-5c06e0e91cf99117b13c","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：表夫妻素爱琮，舍嫡立庶，情计久定；无缘临终举荆州以授备。此亦不然之言。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-46ef7bedb5c1d15794d0","start":0,"end":41}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
